WEBVTT

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:05.653
Huh.

00:00:05.736 --> 00:00:08.572
Clearly you two aren't nearly enough
to get the job done.
显然要成大事 光靠你们俩是不够的

00:00:09.365 --> 00:00:12.409
Time to add to my posse.
是时候再找些帮手了

00:00:12.493 --> 00:00:14.078
What I'm about to do next
我接下来要做的事

00:00:14.161 --> 00:00:17.581
will destroy everything you've worked for,
Buckmeinster.
将毁掉你的毕生心血 巴克埋斯特

00:00:18.415 --> 00:00:19.667
[purring]

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:21.585
-Get out of my face!
-[snarls]
离我远点

00:00:22.795 --> 00:00:25.089
How'd you know those raptors
were gonna attack?
你是怎么知道那些猛龙会来偷袭的？

00:00:25.172 --> 00:00:27.591
Unfortunately, Orson's been tracking you.
不幸的是 奥森一直在追踪你

00:00:27.675 --> 00:00:29.927
Fortunately, I've been tracking Orson.
幸运的是 我一直在追踪奥森

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:31.720
[birds chirp]

00:00:31.804 --> 00:00:34.515
Then, I guess it's up to you guys
to stop 'em.
那也就是说 要阻止他就靠你们俩了

00:00:34.598 --> 00:00:36.976
Two superheroes joining forces again!
两位超级英雄再次联手出击

00:00:37.059 --> 00:00:39.645
Buck Wild and Skunk-a-tor!
巴克·怀尔德和臭鼬女侠

00:00:39.728 --> 00:00:42.189
I can't believe you told them
we were superheroes.
真不敢相信 你告诉他们我们是超级英雄

00:00:42.273 --> 00:00:45.234
I would never say that. They said it.
我从没说过 是他们自己说的

00:00:45.317 --> 00:00:47.486
Well, you two must have been a great team!
你们俩肯定是超棒的团队

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:50.531
Only when we agreed on things,
which was never.
只有在我们意见一致的时候
也就是从来没有啦

00:00:50.614 --> 00:00:51.991
I agree with that.
这点我同意

00:00:52.074 --> 00:00:53.367
What's the problem, Buck?
有什么问题吗 巴克

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:56.328
She's pretty cool
with that super spray of hers.
她那招超级放屁术真厉害

00:00:56.412 --> 00:00:58.289
Hey, what's your superpower anyway?
对了 你的超能力是什么来着？

00:00:58.914 --> 00:01:02.418
Boys, what makes a superhero isn't powers.
小伙子们 成就超级英雄的不是超能力

00:01:05.087 --> 00:01:07.339
It's resourcefulness and courage.
而是智慧和勇气

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:10.467
Yeah, that's what they always say
when they don't have any powers.
对哦 没有超能力的人总这么说

00:01:11.135 --> 00:01:12.887
Anyways, back to the plan.
好了 做正事要紧

00:01:13.429 --> 00:01:16.473
We have a control freak egomaniac
to catch up to.
我们还有个爱指挥人的自大狂要追呢

00:01:16.557 --> 00:01:19.393
Yeah. And we've also gotta stop Orson.
对 除此之外我们还得阻止奥森

00:01:19.476 --> 00:01:21.145
-[animals screaming]
-[gasps]

00:01:24.982 --> 00:01:28.485
This is my worst-case scenario.
They're heading for the watering hole!
这是我最担心的情况
他们往饮水坑的方向去了

00:01:32.656 --> 00:01:34.158
[roaring]

00:01:37.745 --> 00:01:42.750
Blimey. Orson's gonna serve his raptors
an all-you-can-eat mammal buffet.
天哪 奥森要让他的猛龙手下
去那里吃哺乳动物大餐

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:44.752
[slurping]

00:01:46.545 --> 00:01:48.422
Okay, here's the plan.
好 计划是这样的

00:01:49.215 --> 00:01:50.716
[Buck] No time for a plan!
来不及定计划啦

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:53.969
There is always time for a pla--
定计划永远来得及…

00:01:54.053 --> 00:01:56.931
Okay, he can't hear me anymore.
好吧 他已经听不到了

00:01:57.014 --> 00:01:58.515
[birds chirping]

00:02:01.018 --> 00:02:02.978
[grunts, exclaims]

00:02:03.062 --> 00:02:04.271
Whoa! [grunts]

00:02:04.355 --> 00:02:05.397
[grunts]

00:02:05.481 --> 00:02:06.607
[grunts]

00:02:07.191 --> 00:02:08.192
Hey.
喂

00:02:09.902 --> 00:02:13.239
-Everyone, we face a grave threat!
-[chattering]
各位 我们要大祸临头啦

00:02:13.822 --> 00:02:15.783
-Are we out of fruity drinks again?
-[gasping]
果汁又喝完了吗

00:02:15.866 --> 00:02:18.953
We've gotta clear the area.
File out in an orderly fashion.
我们得离开这里
请大家有秩序地排队离开

00:02:19.036 --> 00:02:22.706
-Two by two, one by three, five by nine.
-[chattering]
两两一组 一三一组 五九一组

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:25.459
-[stampeding, growling]
-[animals scream]

00:02:28.921 --> 00:02:30.172
-[growls]
-[gasp]

00:02:31.465 --> 00:02:33.926
Nope, still can't fly. [screams]
还是飞不起来

00:02:34.843 --> 00:02:35.844
[grunts]

00:02:35.928 --> 00:02:37.304
-[growls]
-[grunts]

00:02:38.514 --> 00:02:40.724
-[yells, grunts]
-[growls]

00:02:40.808 --> 00:02:41.976
-No!
-[roars]
不要啊

00:02:42.059 --> 00:02:43.477
[squeals]

00:02:43.561 --> 00:02:45.479
-[beaver screams]
-Go, go, go!
快逃！

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:47.314
-[animals scream]
-[raptors roar]

00:02:48.190 --> 00:02:49.191
[roars]

00:02:50.067 --> 00:02:52.695
[martial arts-style vocalizing]

00:02:53.445 --> 00:02:56.532
It's time to get buck wild!
该我巴克显神威了！

00:02:57.074 --> 00:02:58.075
[Buck] Ow!

00:03:00.869 --> 00:03:02.121
What'd you do that for?
你这是做什么

00:03:02.705 --> 00:03:03.747
Look!
快看

00:03:08.502 --> 00:03:09.545
[raptors growl]

00:03:11.505 --> 00:03:15.384
Buck! Oh, boy,
do I have a surprise for you.
巴克 好家伙 我为你准备了一份惊喜

00:03:16.176 --> 00:03:17.344
Behold!
看哪！

00:03:17.428 --> 00:03:20.389
[raptors roaring]

00:03:24.101 --> 00:03:26.812
He's done it. He's built an army.
他真这么干了 他建立了一支军队

00:03:27.313 --> 00:03:29.732
I'm gonna RSVP "no" to this party.
我们就不陪他们玩了

00:03:30.232 --> 00:03:31.609
We need to get out of here.
此地不宜久留

00:03:33.777 --> 00:03:35.279
[roaring, growling]

00:03:44.538 --> 00:03:45.748
[crunch]

00:03:45.831 --> 00:03:47.458
[squeaking]

00:03:47.541 --> 00:03:49.877
I'm coming for you, Bucky!
我不会放过你的 巴克小子

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:52.796
And you won't weasel your way out
the next time.
下次就不会让你这黄鼠狼轻易脱身啦

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:55.841
You can't protect
the mammals forever, Buck.
你保护不了那些哺乳动物一辈子 巴克

00:03:55.925 --> 00:03:59.595
My new raptor army
will eventually hunt you down.
我的新猛龙大军迟早会抓住你的

00:04:00.179 --> 00:04:02.306
Now we really need a plan.
现在我们真得定个计划了

00:04:02.389 --> 00:04:03.599
[sighs]

00:04:03.682 --> 00:04:08.437
We'll never defeat Orson if you keep going
all "buck wild" without thinking first.
要是你总是不动脑子 只顾“显神威”
那我们就永远无法打败奥森

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:12.524
The more important question
is what does "Zee" stand for?
更重要的问题是 “Z”代表什么？

00:04:13.108 --> 00:04:16.111
Aw. You're cute. [chuckles]
Let's stay on track, shall we?
你真可爱 我们别跑题 好吗

00:04:16.195 --> 00:04:18.739
We are completely outmatched.
我们根本寡不敌众

00:04:18.822 --> 00:04:22.743
If we're gonna defeat Orson,
we're gonna need some big-time help.
要打败奥森 我们需要重量级的帮手

00:04:22.826 --> 00:04:27.706
Hmm. Would you look at that?
I agree with Zee. We do need help.
可不是嘛 我同意小Z的观点
我们的确需要帮手

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:30.960
And there's only one creature
who can handle the job.
而能胜任这项重任的 只有那一位

00:04:34.129 --> 00:04:38.884
Did you hear what he said? He said we!
He sees us as equals.
你听到没 他刚说“我们”
他把我们视为能力相当的同伴

00:04:40.511 --> 00:04:42.054
Actually, I think he meant…
其实 他指的应该是…

00:04:44.348 --> 00:04:46.517
total equals. You got it. [chuckles]
完全是能力相当 没错

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:49.228
Oh, and, uh, by the way, fellas,
the name thing?
对了 伙计们 关于我的名字 小Z就是小Z

00:04:49.311 --> 00:04:51.105
[clicks tongue] It's just Zee.
对了 伙计们 关于我的名字 小Z就是小Z

00:04:51.188 --> 00:04:53.732
-[leaves rustle]
-Yeah, I'm not buying it.
我不信

00:05:00.531 --> 00:05:02.658
My bone boat.
我的骨船

00:05:02.741 --> 00:05:05.369
Whoa! Buck's bone boat.
巴克的骨船

00:05:05.452 --> 00:05:07.246
I believe it's our bone boat.
应该是我们的骨船

00:05:07.329 --> 00:05:10.457
Whoa! Buck and Zee's bone boat.
巴克和小Z的骨船

00:05:11.083 --> 00:05:13.127
-I built it.
-I designed it.
-船是我建的
-是我设计的

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:14.670
It didn't need a design.
这船不需要设计

00:05:14.753 --> 00:05:16.046
[both grunt]

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:17.464
[water splashing]

00:05:17.548 --> 00:05:19.425
That's why the first boat sank.
所以第一艘才沉了

00:05:19.508 --> 00:05:23.137
It didn't sink. The water rose.
它没有沉 是水漫了上来

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:25.014
Do you sense some tension between them?
你觉不觉得他们之间的气氛有些紧张？

00:05:25.097 --> 00:05:26.098
Maybe a little.
可能有一点吧

00:05:44.408 --> 00:05:46.869
We'll reach Lost Lagoon by morning.
我们明早就能到达失落之湖

00:05:48.203 --> 00:05:49.496
You know what I'm wondering?
你知道我在想什么吗

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:52.666
Why we're going to Lost Lagoon
and who's gonna help us defeat Orson?
我们为什么要去失落之湖
还有谁会帮我们打败奥森

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:55.419
No. I'm wondering
why my butt's stuck to the seat.
不 我在想为什么我的屁股粘在了椅子上

00:05:55.502 --> 00:05:56.503
Tree sap.
树汁

00:05:56.587 --> 00:05:58.047
You know what else I'm wondering?
知道我还在想什么吗

00:05:58.130 --> 00:06:00.382
How could they have been
such a fierce team,
他们的团队这么厉害

00:06:00.466 --> 00:06:01.884
but still not get along?
为什么他们还是相处不好呢

00:06:01.967 --> 00:06:04.803
I bet it's 'cause Zee never told him
what the "Zee" stood for.
肯定是因为小Z不肯告诉他
“Z”到底代表了什么

00:06:04.887 --> 00:06:07.848
Okay, out with it. Is it Zeeva?
好吧 快说 是不是“泽娃”？

00:06:07.932 --> 00:06:09.433
-Zelda?
-Zeena?
-泽尔达？
-泽娜？

00:06:09.516 --> 00:06:11.477
-Zsa Zsa? [grunts]
-Zamantha.
-扎扎？
-扎曼莎

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:12.603
Zippy?
炸炸？

00:06:13.354 --> 00:06:15.272
I'm sorry. Did you just say Zippy?
等等 你刚说“炸炸”？

00:06:15.356 --> 00:06:17.024
[as Lefty] I told you it wasn't Zippy.
我就说不是“炸炸”吧

00:06:17.107 --> 00:06:20.110
Uh, once again,
Zee doesn't stand for anything.
再说一遍 “Z”没有任何含义

00:06:20.194 --> 00:06:21.904
And that's not the reason.
而且根本不是因为这个

00:06:21.987 --> 00:06:23.781
So what is the reason?
那究竟是为什么呢

00:06:24.406 --> 00:06:28.160
-It's because he-- Never mind.
-It's because she-- Never mind.
-那是因为他…不提也罢
-那是因为她…不提也罢

00:06:28.702 --> 00:06:30.412
Let's work this out like family.
我们来像一家人一样解决问题

00:06:30.496 --> 00:06:33.123
Yeah, use your feeling words.
对 来用表达感受的词汇

00:06:33.207 --> 00:06:34.500
I feel…
我感觉…

00:06:34.583 --> 00:06:36.418
I feel.
我感觉…

00:06:36.502 --> 00:06:41.006
Well, I feel Buck was stubborn
and reckless.
我感觉巴克既固执又鲁莽

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:44.260
Well, I feel Zee gets too hung up
on details.
我感觉小Z太纠结于细节

00:06:44.343 --> 00:06:47.012
I also feel sad about my first boat.
我还为第一条船感到难过

00:06:47.096 --> 00:06:49.974
[gasps] This is good.
I think we're getting somewhere.
很好 我觉得我们有进展了

00:06:50.057 --> 00:06:52.226
You're irresponsible, thickheaded.
你是个不负责任的笨蛋

00:06:52.309 --> 00:06:54.353
-You're demanding, and you're always…
-I'm tired of you…
-你最不让人省心 总是…
-我受够了你…

00:06:54.436 --> 00:06:56.522
-…being mean to me.
-…always leaping before you look.
-对我那么刻薄
-做什么事都不计后果

00:06:56.605 --> 00:06:59.358
-Recklessly hurling us into trouble.
-…but the rest of the team didn't.
-鲁莽轻率 给我们惹麻烦
-但队里其他人却没有

00:06:59.441 --> 00:07:00.943
We needed to have a strategy.
我们得制定战略

00:07:01.026 --> 00:07:02.528
Your way didn't work!
你那套不管用

00:07:02.611 --> 00:07:04.154
We lost our team.
我们失去了我们的队友

00:07:05.614 --> 00:07:10.536
I know, Zee. But maybe there was nothing
we could do to save them.
我知道 小Z 但或许我们根本救不了他们

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:14.039
Maybe not, but you were my best friend.
或许是这样 但你曾是我最好的朋友

00:07:14.915 --> 00:07:16.333
And I lost you too.
而我连你都失去了

00:07:18.544 --> 00:07:20.296
Zee. [sighs]
小Z

00:07:22.339 --> 00:07:23.382
[groans]

00:07:24.216 --> 00:07:26.093
I feel that could've gone better.
我觉得本不该闹成这样的

